# Root-context allowlist for all memo image builds.
**
!memo
!memo/**
!training-sdk
!training-sdk/**
!rtrrl
!rtrrl/infra
!rtrrl/infra/worker
!rtrrl/infra/worker/worker.py

# Never send local environments, VCS/worktree metadata, caches, or run state.
.git
.git/**
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/.venv
**/.venv/**
**/__pycache__
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/*.egg-info/**
**/.pytest_cache
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.ruff_cache
**/.ruff_cache/**
**/.mypy_cache
**/.mypy_cache/**
**/.cache
**/.cache/**
**/history
**/history/**
**/Aim
**/Aim/**
**/aim
**/aim/**
**/Optuna
**/Optuna/**
**/optuna
**/optuna/**
**/artifacts
**/artifacts/**
**/logs
**/logs/**
**/_runlogs
**/_runlogs/**
**/wandb
**/wandb/**

# Common secret and credential names.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*credentials*
**/*secret*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
